From 6f94fd96866e43c655acb507979f1a96b7147d52 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 12:01:17 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 10/18] Round 9: Run sixteen lanes for lean reservoir scoring

Lean reservoir groups now run sixteen interleaved lanes, then 8, 4
and 1; full records keep at most eight lanes because their extra
per-lane state did not benefit. Engine groups grow to sixteen
reservoir candidates. The shared reservoir_day step is unchanged, so
results are bit-identical; the lane tests now include a 33-candidate
batch.

Workload: lean domain2 (48 reservoir scores of 2,400 days), 11 samples
against round 8.
Before median: 0.511 ms. After median: 0.405 ms. Speedup: 1.26x.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
